00:02:36.344 --> 00:02:38.610
- That was in LA, Salle Central.

00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:39.675
- [Mark] Salle Central?
- Hmm.

00:02:39.675 --> 00:02:41.577
- [Mark] I figure out.
- Hmm.

