- Yeah

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:11.560
- [Mark] And you've
worked with a pimp before?

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:13.840
- Yeah. But like I said, I ran away a lot.

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:16.163
So like, that only
lasted for about a week.

00:03:16.163 --> 00:03:17.460
(chuckles)

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:18.910
I really like listening.

00:03:18.910 --> 00:03:19.743
- [Mark] Yeah.

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:23.020
